es with a 90.6% accuracy rate — but less than 15% have been patched. AI-powered auditing is reshaping security."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/blog/ai-frontend-revolution","name":"AI Is Rewriting the Rules of Frontend: From 62% Job Losses to a $1,100 Next.js Clone","description":"Junior frontend roles dropped 62%, but top-tier talent salaries surged 70%. Cloudflare rebuilt Next.js for $1,100 in API fees. Three major frameworks just shipped game-changing releases — frontend is undergoing a forced evolution."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/blog/mbti-personality-test-guide","name":"How to Read an MBTI Personality Test: From Four Letters to Self-Understanding","description":"Understand the four MBTI preference pairs, how ToolOrbit's MBTI tool scores answers, how to interpret result cards, and why the outcome is best used for reflection rather than labeling."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/blog/mbti-four-dimensions-explained","name":"MBTI Four Dimensions Explained: What E/I, S/N, T/F, and J/P Mean","description":"A practical guide to Extraversion vs Introversion, Sensing vs Intuition, Feeling vs Thinking, and Perceiving vs Judging so you can read MBTI results with better context."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/blog/mbti-16-personality-types-guide","name":"16 MBTI Personality Types: Strengths, Blind Spots, and Communication Tips","description":"Explore all 16 MBTI types by Analysts, Diplomats, Sentinels, and Explorers, with quick notes on work style, relationship needs, and growth reminders."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":7,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/blog/codex-gpt-image-2-workflow","name":"Codex and GPT Image 2: A Practical Workflow for Project Assets","description":"Learn when to use Codex image generation, how to write reliable GPT Image 2 prompts, save outputs into your project, and avoid common asset workflow mistakes."},{"@type":